WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.214
AI supply chain risk cannot be eliminated, but it can be reduced through layered controls and continuous improvement.

2
00:00:07.214 --> 00:00:20.973
Practical steps include maintaining inventories, reviewing model provenance, validating data sources, managing dependencies, securing build pipelines, limiting tool permissions, and reviewing third-party services.

3
00:00:20.973 --> 00:00:29.803
Teams should also monitor behavior, document ownership, define review workflows, and update systems as risks and dependencies change.

4
00:00:29.803 --> 00:00:32.068
The goal is not to freeze innovation.

5
00:00:32.068 --> 00:00:38.713
The goal is to build AI systems with enough visibility, discipline, and governance to manage risk responsibly.
